      "mergeID": "6053ccc7e3c42a495da4a3ac",
      "mergedPostDetails": "The loading bar for worlds or avatars fills slower and the percentage counts up slower than the mb/mb display. Then jumps to 100% when done. This is especially noticeable the bigger the to-load asset is.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Loading Percent and bar are calculated wrongly",
