      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The go button appears immediately afterwards, so what I think is actually happening is it is including the time to build the assets after download in the progress bar so you aren't staring at a full 100% bar for several seconds. If your PC is fast like mine, that last few percent tends to just fill instantly and the go button appears. I think it is intended and I personally like it better this way.\nThe first screenshot isn't a big priority since it is just a visual bug and goes away a split second later when the download progress starts.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
